<svg is:raw style="width:100%;font-family:'Inter',serif;" viewBox="0 0 640 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">

          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10" font-style="italic" opacity="0.7" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="16">Three failure modes - what deep engagement looks like when the arc is misused</text>

          <!-- Block 1: Lens Lock -->
          <rect fill="var(--accent-light)" height="150" opacity="0.5" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.8" width="195" x="10" y="28"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" opacity="0.8" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="48">Lens Lock</text>
          <line opacity="0.3" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.4" x1="20" x2="195" y1="55" y2="55"></line>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="72">The lens becomes a filter.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="84">User can no longer see the</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="96">domain through any other</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="108">frame. Looks like loyalty.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="120">Is dependency.</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" opacity="0.6" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="148">Symptom: User cannot</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" opacity="0.6" text-anchor="middle" x="107" y="160">articulate competing views.</text>

          <!-- Block 2: Arc Capture -->
          <rect fill="var(--accent-light)" height="150" opacity="0.5" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.8" width="196" x="222" y="28"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" opacity="0.8" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="48">Arc Capture</text>
          <line opacity="0.3" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.4" x1="232" x2="408" y1="55" y2="55"></line>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="72">User is kept perpetually</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="84">in the road of trials.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="96">The arc never completes.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="108">Transformation deferred</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="120">indefinitely.</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" opacity="0.6" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="148">Symptom: High return rate,</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" opacity="0.6" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="160">zero elixir produced.</text>

          <!-- Block 3: Identity Capture -->
          <rect fill="var(--accent-light)" height="150" opacity="0.7" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" width="195" x="435" y="28"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="48">Identity Capture</text>
          <line opacity="0.4" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.5" x1="445" x2="620" y1="55" y2="55"></line>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="72">The field becomes part of</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="84">the user's self-definition.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="96">Disagreement feels like</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="108">self-betrayal. Looks like</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="120">maximum engagement.</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="148">Symptom: Community turns</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" x="532" y="160">on dissenters.</text>

          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="198">All three failure modes look like success on engagement dashboards. None are.</text>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" opacity="0.6" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="211">The ethical boundary: does the arc increase or decrease the user's independence from it?</text>
        </svg>